---
// src/pages/en/Saxofonist.astro
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Layout
	title="Saxophonist | Javier Flores — Musician & International Tours"
	description="Javier Flores, saxophonist and scholarship musician: soloist, arranger, and founding member of the Atlixco Chamber Orchestra, with international tours in Taiwan and the UAE."
	lang="en"
	pathEs="saxofonista"
	pathEn="saxophonist"
>
	<!-- Banner -->
		<section id="banner" class="style2">
			<div class="inner">
				<span class="image">
					<img src={`${base}images/Javier-Flores-Yilan-Taiwan.webp`} alt="Javier Flores performing as saxophonist during the international tour in Yilan, Taiwan" />
				</span>
				<header class="major">
					<h1>Saxophonist</h1>
				</header>
				<div class="content">
					<p>I started playing at age 8 and have since gathered incredible experiences as a musician—ranging from earning a university scholarship and founding an orchestra in my hometown to participating in 2 international tours.</p> <br>
					<p>Here are some of the projects, ensembles, and events I've had the privilege of being a part of.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

	<!-- Main -->
		<div id="main">
			<!-- Two -->
				<section id="two" class="spotlights">
					<section>
						<iframe src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/334967451" width="640" height="500" frameborder="0" allow="autoplay; fullscreen" allowfullscreen></iframe>
						<div class="content">
							<div class="inner">
								<header class="major">
									<h2>Representative Musician - ITESM Puebla</h2>
								</header>
								<p>I am a scholarship student at Tecnológico de Monterrey for cultural talent, playing alto, tenor, and soprano saxophone. I provide scholarship service as a representative musician for the university and have also performed with the university chamber orchestra and marching band.</p> <br>
								<p>I have taken part in musicals, concerts, ensembles, and many other school-organized events where I have had the pleasure of performing as a soloist on numerous occasions in large venues hosting over 4,000 attendees.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</section>
					<section>
						<iframe src="https://www.facebook.com/plugins/video.php?href=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2Falejandro.c.gonzalez.12%2Fvideos%2F10155880273594613%2F&width=600&show_text=false&height=500&appId" width="600" height="500" style="border:none;overflow:hidden" scrolling="no" frameborder="0" allowTransparency="true" allow="encrypted-media" allowFullScreen="true"></iframe>
						<div class="content">
							<div class="inner">
								<header class="major">
									<h2>International Tours</h2>
								</header>
								<p>I am currently part of the musician lineup for the Hidalgo Magisterial Folkloric Company, with whom I have had the fortune of collaborating on 2 international tours.</p><br>
								<p>The first tour took place in Taiwan for the "Yilan International Children’s Folklore and Folkgame Festival" in 2018, one of the largest folklore festivals worldwide.</p> <br>
								<p>My second experience was in the United Arab Emirates at the "Sharjah Heritage Days" festival, where we performed our music in the cities of Sharjah and Dubai, and recorded in a recording studio at the University City of Sharjah.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</section>
					<section>
						<iframe width="600" height="500" scrolling="no" frameborder="no" allow="autoplay" src="https://w.soundcloud.com/player/?url=https%3A//api.soundcloud.com/tracks/135787483&color=%23ff5500&auto_play=false&hide_related=false&show_comments=true&show_user=true&show_reposts=false&show_teaser=true&visual=true"></iframe>
						<div class="content">
							<div class="inner">
								<header class="major">
									<h2>Cóctel Calavera</h2>
								</header>
								<p>I have been part of several musical bands, but one that left me with incredible experiences was Cóctel Calavera, with whom I performed at various festivals, events, and contests, as well as recording several tracks. Listen to some Cóctel Calavera on SoundCloud.</p>
								<ul class="actions">
									<li><a href="https://www.facebook.com/CoctelCalavera/" class="button">Cóctel Calavera on Facebook</a></li>
								</ul>
							</div>
						</div>
					</section>
					<section>
						<iframe src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/334967419" width="640" height="500" frameborder="0" allow="autoplay; fullscreen" allowfullscreen></iframe>
						<div class="content">
							<div class="inner">
								<header class="major">
									<h2>Song Festivals</h2>
								</header>
								<p>One of my favorite university events is the Song Festival, where I have regularly enjoyed participating and competing alongside great musicians and composers from my university since day one.</p> <br>
								<p>I have been fortunate to receive honorary mentions as one of the best musicians of the festival. Additionally, a track I co-wrote and composed with a university friend won Best Lyrics in the 2018 festival. The saxophone arrangements for every piece I performed were entirely my own.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</section>
					<section>
						<a href="#" class="image" aria-label="Atlixco Chamber Orchestra">
							<img src={`${base}images/Orquesta-de-Camara-de-Atlixco.webp`} alt="Photo of the Atlixco Chamber Orchestra ensemble with founding member Javier Flores" width="600" height="320" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
						</a>
						<div class="content">
							<div class="inner">
								<header class="major">
									<h2>Atlixco Chamber Orchestra</h2>
								</header>
								<p>The Atlixco Chamber Orchestra was a project launched in 2013 aimed at bringing together the finest young musicians in Atlixco to form the city's very first orchestra.</p><br>
								<p>I was one of the founding members of the project where, aside from being a performing musician, I handled roles as manager, arranger, and section leader, among others.</p>
								<ul class="actions">
									<li><a href="https://www.facebook.com/Orquesta-de-C%C3%A1mara-de-Atlixco-232123190316860/" class="button">OCA on Facebook</a></li>
								</ul>
							</div>
						</div>
					</section>
				</section>
		</div>

    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');

        body, #wrapper {
            background-color: #0f131f !important;
            color: #e2e8f0;
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif !important;
        }

        h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6 {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif !important;
        }
    </style>
</Layout>
